# A mysqldump of a working database is machine state, not source. `Documentation/ems-demo-backup.sql`
# was tracked this way from 2026-09-12 to 2026-10-26 (its rows are the synthetic demo cast, so this is
# hygiene rather than exposure — but history is why the rule is *never*, not *carefully*). Take dumps to
# C:\Users\ADMIN\ems-backups\, which is where AGENTS.md already sends them.
/Documentation/*.sql
/node_modules
